  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> has three roots and thus <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>\"</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> will have atleast two roots in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
